Dimensional simulation.
The reference area is 0.0721045 m^2.
The semi-span will be computed using the max y(3D) value.
The reference length is 1 m.
Reference origin for moment evaluation is (0, 0, 0).
Surface(s) where the force coefficients are evaluated: wall.

Surface(s) plotted in the output file: wall.
Input mesh file name: mesh.su2

--------------- Space Numerical Integration ( Zone 0 ) ------------------
AUSM solver for the flow inviscid terms.
Standard Roe without low-dissipation function.
Second order integration in space, with slope limiter.
Venkatakrishnan-Wang slope-limiting method, with constant: 0.05.
Average of gradients with correction (viscous flow terms).
Gradient for upwind reconstruction: inverse-distance weighted Least-Squares.
Gradient for viscous and source terms: inverse-distance weighted Least-Squares.

--------------- Time Numerical Integration  ( Zone 0 ) ------------------
Local time stepping (steady state simulation).
Euler implicit method for the flow equations.
BCGSTAB is used for solving the linear system.
Using LU-SGS preconditioning.
Convergence criteria of the linear solver: 1e-05.
Max number of linear iterations: 10.
CFL adaptation. Factor down: 0.5, factor up: 1.1,
                lower limit: 0.05, upper limit: 5,
                acceptable linear residual: 0.001'
                starting iteration: 0.
Courant-Friedrichs-Lewy number:      0.1

------------------ Convergence Criteria  ( Zone 0 ) ---------------------
Maximum number of solver subiterations: 600.
Begin convergence monitoring at iteration 10.
Residual minimum value: 1e-8.
Cauchy series min. value: 1e-10.
Number of Cauchy elements: 100.
Begin windowed time average at iteration 0.

